This template is provided as-is, for you to build on. Use it for anything.

The apps you build from it are yours; nothing here asks for attribution.

Note that the *built app* ships third-party open-source code (androidx, Kotlin,
Coroutines, Coil, Room and their transitive dependencies). Those obligations are
real and travel with your binary — which is what `licensee`, the generated
licences screen and `app/src/main/assets/licences/` exist to satisfy. Do not
remove them.
